The priest can be easy or hard, depending on whether you hit him from
inside the temple, or shoot at him from just outside. If you shoot
from outside the temple, then (a) the priest will never approach you,
and (b) the god of the altar won't hurt you (not to mention (c) the
priest won't leave his temple.) Try and get him by reflecting a magic
missile off a wall, one or two of them should do it.

Of course, the really classy way to do it for Chaotics in a
non-chaotic temple, is to kill the priest first, then sacrifice him on
his own altar, you're guaranteed to turn it chaotic *and* get a demon
lord that you don't have to fight (which means that he can't be
summoned *hostile* later, if he's already around and peaceful.)

